#: index.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kde; is a powerful graphical desktop environment for &UNIX; workstations. A "
"&kde; desktop combines ease of use, contemporary functionality and "
"outstanding graphical design with the technological superiority of the "
"&UNIX; operating system."
msgstr ""
"&kde; e-st on poûxhant evironmint grafike di buro po les ståcions &UNIX;. "
"On buro &kde;E e-st åjhey a eployî, il a totes les usteyes k' i vs fåt "
"dins ene éndjole d' ådjourdu, il est pår bea et, al copete do martchî, "
"il est bati so &UNIX;, li meyeu sistinme d' operance k' i gn åye."

